il car accident last Friday, kinda upsetting but no one was hurt. I've been dealing with insurance and repairs - taking up a lot of time and energy. Look at this photo!\n[Image caption: a photo of a red car with a black rim parked on a sidewalk]\n[S9T1] (dia_id: D9:1)\n\nDave: Sorry to hear about the car accident, Calvin. I'm glad to hear that nobody was hurt. Dealing with insurance and repairs can definitely be time-consuming and draining. Have you encountered any issues in the insurance process so far?\n[S9T2] (dia_id: D9:2)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave, thanks for checking in! The insurance process was a hassle - it took forever and there was a ton of paperwork. But it's all sorted now, and I'm getting it fixed up. Can't wait to drive it again!\n[Image caption: a photo of a tow truck parked in a parking lot]\n[S9T3] (dia_id: D9:3)\n\nDave: How long did it take to get everything sorted out? I'm glad it's all taken care of now!\n[S9T4] (dia_id: D9:4)\n\nCalvin: It only took a week to sort everything out. I was worried about the cost, but it wasn't too bad. Look at this photo from the auto repair shop. \n[Image caption: a photography of a man working on a car in a garage]\n[S9T5] (dia_id: D9:5)","text_sha256":"98648ea68b2984231743a12b760ead0f58a6edf1944530e2fc7a618e4a969966","timestamp":"2023-06-21T15:15:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D5:10"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":44,"line_start":43,"source_locators":["[S5T10]"],"text_sha256":"4f0f0ab19844238c2d8d3be87e2b84090602855f1cb3f8b6e29ac094d25ed0c5"}],"dia_ids":["D5:10"],"evidence_id":"ev-25a7380e5b6dcb0896341cfac63d09e4dab59e694b3f47980e7e3d00551135f4","group_id":"session_5","line_end":44,"line_start":43,"observation_ids":["obs-0007"],"path":"/memories/session-05.md","query_terms":[],"rank":null,"records_sha256":"130a5a1e1b75083358ef27a98dd215a4e75c819ace6f2ee9b560ba394e0f0394","retrieval_round":9,"schema_version":1,"score"